<h1><span class="threecol textleft">Nationalrat, XXII.GP</span>
<span class="threecol textcenter">Stenographisches Protokoll</span>
<span class="threecol textright" style="float: right">103. Sitzung / Seite 149</span></h1>
<span class="fourcol textleft"><a href="/index.shtml">Home</a></span>
<span class="fourcol textcenter"><a href="/PAKT/VHG/XXII/NRSITZ/NRSITZ_00103/SEITE_0001.html">Seite 1</a></span>
<span class="fourcol textcenter"><a href="/PAKT/VHG/XXII/NRSITZ/NRSITZ_00103/SEITE_0148.html">Vorherige Seite</a></span>
<span class="fourcol textright" style="float: right"><a href="/PAKT/VHG/XXII/NRSITZ/NRSITZ_00103/SEITE_0150.html">N&auml;chste Seite</a></span><hr>

<div class=Section1>
<p class=MsoNormal><i><span lang=DE-AT>(&Uuml;ber Namensaufruf durch die
Schriftf&uuml;hrer <b>Wimmer</b> und <A HREF="/WWER/PAD_00039/">Jakob&nbsp;<b>Auer</A></b> werfen die Ab&shy;geordneten
die Stimmzettel in die Urne.)<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span lang=DE-AT style='display:none;mso-hide:all'><span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
</div>
<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span lang=DE-AT style='font-size:1.10em; mso-bidi-font-size:1.00em;font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";display:none;mso-hide:all;mso-ansi-language: DE-AT;mso-fareast-language:DE;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><br clear=all style='page-break-before:auto;mso-break-type:section-break'>
</span></b>
<div class=Section2>
<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span lang=DE-AT style='display:none;mso-hide:all'><!--�--></span><span lang=DE-AT>Pr&auml;sidentin <A HREF="/WWER/PAD_04476/">Mag.
Barbara&nbsp;Prammer</A><span style='display:none;mso-hide:all'><!--�--></span>:</span></b><span lang=DE-AT> Die Stimmabgabe ist beendet.</span></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=DE-AT>Die damit beauftragten Bediensteten des
Hauses werden nunmehr unter Aufsicht der Schriftf&uuml;hrer die Stimmenausz&auml;hlung
vornehmen.</span></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=DE-AT>Die Sitzung wird zu diesem Zweck f&uuml;r einige
Minuten <b><i>unterbrochen.<o:p></o:p></i></b></span></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE-AT>(Die
zust&auml;ndigen Beamten nehmen die Stimmenausz&auml;hlung vor.&nbsp;&#8211; Die Sitzung wird
um 17.10&nbsp;Uhr <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>unterbrochen</b> und
um 17.16&nbsp;Uhr <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>wieder aufgenommen.</b>)<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span lang=DE-AT style='display:none;mso-hide:all'><span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
</div>
<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span lang=DE-AT style='font-size:1.10em; mso-bidi-font-size:1.00em;font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";display:none;mso-hide:all;mso-ansi-language: DE-AT;mso-fareast-language:DE;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><br clear=all style='page-break-before:auto;mso-break-type:section-break'>
</span></b>
<div class=Section3>
<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span lang=DE-AT style='display:none;mso-hide:all'><!--�--></span><span lang=DE-AT>Pr&auml;sidentin <A HREF="/WWER/PAD_04476/">Mag.
Barbara&nbsp;Prammer</A><span style='display:none;mso-hide:all'><!--�--></span>:</span></b><span lang=DE-AT> Ich <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style: normal'>nehme </i></b>die unterbrochene Sitzung <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight: normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>wieder auf </i></b>und gebe das
Abstimmungsergebnis wie folgt bekannt:</span></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=DE-AT>Abgegebene Stimmen: <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight: normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>176,</i></b> davon <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>&#8222;Ja&#8220;</i></b>-Stimmen
<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>97,</i></b>
<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>&#8222;Nein&#8220;</i></b>-Stimmen
<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>79.</i></b></span></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=DE-AT>Der Entschlie&szlig;ungsantrag der Abgeordneten
Wittauer, Miedl, Kolleginnen und Kolle&shy;gen ist somit <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight: normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>angenommen.</i></b> <i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>(E&nbsp;97.) (Beifall bei der &Ouml;VP und den
Freiheitlichen.)</i></span></p>
<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=DE-AT>Gem&auml;&szlig; &sect;&nbsp;66 Abs.&nbsp;8 der </span><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Gesch&auml;ftsordnung werden die Namen der
Abgeordneten unter Angabe ihres Abstimmungsverhaltens in das Stenographische
Protokoll aufgenom&shy;men.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><u><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Mit <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>&#8222;Ja&#8220;</b>
stimmten die Abgeordneten:<o:p></o:p></span></u></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Achleitner, Amon, Auer Jakob, Auer Klaus Hubert;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Baumgartner-Gabitzer, Bleckmann, B&ouml;hm, B&ouml;hmdorfer,
B&ouml;sch, Brader Alfred, Brinek, Bucher;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Donabauer Karl, Donnerbauer Heribert, Doppler;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Ellmauer, E&szlig;l;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Fekter, Felzmann, Franz, Freund, Fuhrmann;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Gahr Hermann, Glaser, Grander, Grillitsch,
Gro&szlig;ruck;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Hakl, Haubner Peter, Haupt Herbert, Hofmann,
H&ouml;llerer, Hornek, Huainigg, H&uuml;tl;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Ikrath;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Kainz, Kapeller, Keuschnigg, Khol, Kogler, Kopf,
K&ouml;&szlig;l, Kurzbauer;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Langreiter, Ledolter, Lentsch, Liechtenstein
Vincenz, Lopatka;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Machne, Maier Ferdinand, Marek, Miedl, Mikesch,
Missethon, Mitterlehner Reinhold, Mitterm&uuml;ller Marialuise, Molterer, Murauer;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Neudeck, Neugebauer;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Pack, Partik-Pabl&eacute;, Pilz, Pra&szlig;l, Preineder, Prinz,
Prinzhorn;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>R&auml;dler Johann, Rasinger, Regler Roderich, Riener,
Rosenkranz, Rossmann;<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:.70em;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.70em; margin-left:0cm'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=DE style='mso-ansi-language:DE'>Scheibner, Scheuch, Scheucher-Pichler,
Schiefermair, Sch&ouml;ls, Schultes, Schweisgut, Sieber, Sonnberger, Spindelegger
